 ('Lab corridor',[('Ana','How did you come across that old paper?','Como você encontrou aquele artigo antigo?'),('Dev','By accident. It came up in a footnote.','Por acaso. Apareceu numa nota de rodapé.'),('Ana','Did it come under fire back then?','Foi criticado na época?'),('Dev','Heavily. It all came down to one assumption.','Muito. Tudo se resumia a uma suposição.')]),
 [('Use “come up with”.','Use.','She came up with a clever objection.'),('Use “come across as”.','Use.','He comes across as cautious.'),('Use “come to terms with”.','Use.','I came to terms with being wrong.')],
 ('Write a 5-step infographic text (one line per step) about how a new habit becomes normal, using five different come expressions.','Step 1: Someone comes up with a new routine. Step 2: Friends come across it online. Step 3: It comes under fire as a fad. Step 4: Results come to light. Step 5: Sceptics come around.',['Usei **5 expressões com come**','Frases curtas'],'5 linhas'),
