 ('Write a 6-sentence news report on a fictional committee meeting, attributing each claim to a source.','The city’s ethics panel met on Monday to discuss drone surveillance. Councillor Ruiz argued that it threatens privacy. The police chief maintained that it prevents crime. A spokesperson declined to say whether a vote would follow. According to minutes seen by this newspaper, members were divided. The panel is expected to report in May.',['Usei **argued / maintained**','Usei **According to**','Usei **declined to say**'],'6 frases'),
